@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness: model provider configured and reachable
GET {{host}}/ready

### Safe config
GET {{host}}/api/config

### Operational diagnostics
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled

### First turn
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What does policy AGENT-IDENTITY require?"
}

### Continue a conversation
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "replace-with-id-from-first-response",
  "message": "Create a mock draft change request to align an agent to that policy."
}

### Forget in-memory conversation
DELETE {{host}}/api/conversations/replace-with-id-from-first-response
